### 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/prompts/create
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=테스트 제목&
description=테스트 설명&
content = 테스트 내용&
categoryId=1

### 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/prompts/list

### 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/prompts/detail?id=1

### 수정
POST http://localhost:8080/api/prompts/update
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

promptId=13&
categoryId=2&
title=수정된 제목&
description=수정된 설명&
content=수정된 내용

### 삭제
POST http://localhost:8080/api/prompts/delete
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

promptId=13